9. DatabaseService.cs
Purpose

Communication with PostgreSQL.

SaveTagConfiguration()

Stores tag configuration.

LT101
Tank Level
0-100

Table:

scada_tags
LoadTagConfigurations()

Loads tags during startup.

DeleteTagConfiguration()

Deletes tag.

LogTelemetry()

Stores live values.

Table:

telemetry_history

Example:

LT101
2026-06-11 10:00:00
52.1
FetchHistoricalTelemetry()

Loads historical data.

Used by:

BtnLoadHistory_Click()

Returns:

Timestamp
Value

for selected period.

10. ConfigurationService.cs
Purpose

Stores dashboard layout in JSON.

File:

HydroDashboardLayout.json

Saves:

Tag configurations

Loads:

Tag configurations

when app starts.

11. TelemetryProcessor.cs
Purpose

Central data processing engine.

Currently:

tag.CurrentValue = value;
series.Append(...);

